  "daily_update": "Common Sense Voters Coalition was the leading reported advertiser on Facebook on Oct 19, with $872,537 in spend across 1,016 ads in Meta's Ad Library.",
  "methodology": "Digital Politics automatically collects Meta\u2019s public United States \u2018Last day\u2019 Ad Library report and retains each raw report privately. The cumulative figure begins with the 90-day baseline ending Sept 20, 2026, then adds subsequent daily reports. Figures cover political, election and issue ads delivered via Facebook in the United States, including Washington, DC, but excluding territories and Meta\u2019s \u2018Unknown\u2019 location. State delivery does not establish congressional-district targeting, campaign coordination or electoral effect. Cumulative spend and state totals include daily reports through Oct 23, 2026. The overall advertiser rankings and advertiser count retain the previously published snapshot; the daily advertiser rankings include the latest report."
